{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>壓力突然來襲時，未必有時間坐下來慢慢調整呼吸。MicroWell 以口袋工具的形式提供即時減壓方案，透過科學化微冥想與呼吸練習，讓用家在 30 至 120 秒內重拾平靜。無論是辦公室、家中或外出途中，都能隨時使用。程式原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>呼吸練習與壓力預算追蹤</h2>\n<p>MicroWell 提供 30、60 或 120 秒的引導呼吸練習，配合視覺呼吸圓圈與觸感回饋，以科學化節奏快速平復情緒。內置壓力預算功能，可記錄每日壓力水平與觸發原因，並以圖表呈現週月趨勢。另備 45 秒至 5 分鐘的微冥想庫，涵蓋專注、平靜、能量與睡眠，附引導指示及可選觸感回饋，更支援深色模式，且無訂閱與廣告。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1125-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1126-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1127-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1128-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1129-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-1130-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：MicroWell – Stress Relief</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-12T23:39:00.164810+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":367,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}